179569, "until": 1795634121.0094223, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 4543, "layer": "worker", "category": "thinking", "kind": "session.agent_thought_chunk", "role": "idea-review-repo", "actor": null, "execution_id": "73197538b27ac9f4b9b10091b3050342", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "thinking", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "thinking (50 chunks, content withheld)"}, {"id": "dd27da92-fc06-51a0-a294-787eb3bc08a7", "at": 1795634121.899429, "until": 1795634122.0164514, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 4593, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.agent_message_chunk", "role": "idea-review-repo", "actor": "idea-review-repo", "execution_id": "73197538b27ac9f4b9b10091b3050342", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "message (59 chunks)", "shown": {"message": "I checked `idea-repo`'s answer to round 2 (#4) against Brief revision 4, and I have no new request for it.\n\nAll three P5 defects are fixed:\n- S is now measured against the reporting specification.\n- The within-cell test is read against a null simulation.\n- L is tested across cells, and bias and variance each have their own target.\n\nThe cell budget (about 160 cells), the edge-noise slice, the corner check and the signal-to-noise table are in place.\n\nTwo residual concerns are for the plan review, not a reopened request. The core factorial uses one family and d ∈ {5, 20, 80}. That leaves few points for the P1 exponent fits and for the leave-one-family-out test, so the Outline has to say which slice cells carry them. Both stay open for `story-repo`'s Outline, when it appears."}}, {"id": "e2ad4993-df6f-55b0-a51e-b3f712ee736c", "at": 1795634122.0182917, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 4652, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "idea-review-repo", "actor": "idea-review-repo", "execu